{"ocrText": "109\nANOTHER  COMMISSIONS\nIt  is  clearly  the  capitalists  who  will  take  decisions.\nAnother body is to be set up that at best will benefit no\none.\nFurther, there are to be, as usual, countless commissions,\nsub-commissions,  committees,  etc.\nThat is how they intend to combat economic disintegra-\ntion.\nA  shark  has  been  thrown  into  the  water.\nPravda  No.  85,\nPublished  according  to\nJuly  1   (June  18),  1917\nthe  Pravda  text", "textLayer": [{"text": "109", "x": 85.54, "y": 6.06, "w": 3.33, "h": 1.56, "fontSize": 9.2}, {"text": "ANOTHER  COMMISSIONS", "x": 36.0, "y": 6.11, "w": 25.82, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "It  is  clearly  the  capitalists  who  will  take  decisions.", "x": 11.67, "y": 9.53, "w": 72.07, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Another body is to be set up that at best will benefit no", "x": 11.67, "y": 11.47, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "one.", "x": 8.89, "y": 13.39, "w": 5.37, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Further, there are to be, as usual, countless commissions,", "x": 11.67, "y": 15.33, "w": 77.22, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "sub-commissions,  committees,  etc.", "x": 8.89, "y": 17.27, "w": 46.43, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "That is how they intend to combat economic disintegra-", "x": 11.67, "y": 19.2, "w": 77.23, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "tion.", "x": 8.89, "y": 21.14, "w": 5.95, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "A  shark  has  been  thrown  into  the  water.", "x": 11.67, "y": 23.08, "w": 57.91, "h": 1.85, "fontSize": 11.0}, {"text": "Pravda", "x": 12.5, "y": 26.97, "w": 7.16, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "No.", "x": 20.56, "y": 26.96, "w": 3.23, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "85", "x": 24.71, "y": 27.01, "w": 2.1, "h": 1.28, "fontSize": 7.6}, {"text": ",", "x": 26.96, "y": 26.96, "w": 0.53, "h": 1.35, "fontSize": 8.0}, {"text": "Published", "x": 66.01, "y": 26.96, "w": 9.43, "h": 1.35, "fontSize